	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "c1f7b824-81d3-4e5a-9092-23f4625b90a1",
		"name": "ApnaPay - KYC APIs",
		"description": "Postman Collection for ApnaPay KYC (Know Your Customer) Endpoints.\n\n### Base URL:\n`http://localhost:5000`\n\n### Features Included:\n1. Server Health Check\n2. Get KYC Status\n3. Submit KYC (Creates initial pending KYC request)\n4. Add KYC Documents (Aadhaar, PAN, Passport etc.)\n5. Get All KYC Documents\n6. Delete Pending KYC Document\n\nIncludes pre-configured headers, sample payloads, and automated test scripts to capture `documentId` dynamically.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
